    {
      "id": "ZH-W64-qi-rise",
      "sequence": 5315,
      "title": "起 (qǐ) — the walking piece, carrying jǐ",
      "headword": "起",
      "romanization": "qǐ",
      "gloss": "起 — the walking piece, carrying jǐ",
      "script": "chinese",
      "modality": "pen",
      "derivedModality": "pen",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "writing-type",
        "script-block"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:9cfb743e6e9e4a8f",
      "notice": {
        "modality": "pen",
        "needs": [
          "a pen and something to write on",
          "your eyes, for letter shapes on the page"
        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [
          "Warm-up",
          "Script — the walking piece, carrying jǐ",
          "Guided Practice"
        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your hands, so it is not a driving lesson. You will want a pen and something to write on and your eyes, for letter shapes on the page. You can listen to everything else now. I will say so again when we reach them, but leave these sections until you have stopped: Warm-up, Script — the walking piece, carrying jǐ and Guided Practice."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The word first, then the character inside it."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say duìbuqǐ — R1, one lesson back, before it decays",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *duìbuqǐ* — **R1**, one lesson back, before it decays]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "对 不."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "each one aloud, with nothing said first — duì, bù",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: each one aloud, with nothing said first — *duì*, *bù*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "script",
          "title": "Script — the walking piece, carrying jǐ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "起 (qǐ)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two pieces: the walking piece first, then the piece on its back."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The walking piece, seven strokes, read zǒu, as in the word for to walk: a short horizontal, a vertical down through it, a longer horizontal; then below, a short vertical with a short bar to its right, a left-falling stroke, and last a long stroke that sweeps right along the whole bottom."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The right piece, three strokes, read jǐ, 'self', not the jǐ of 机, sitting on the sweep: a horizontal that turns down, a short horizontal, then a vertical that bends right along the bottom and hooks up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "7 + 3 = ten."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "WRITE",
              "instruction": "起 (qǐ), all ten, with the model in front of you",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU WRITE: 起, all ten, with the model in front of you]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "COVER",
              "instruction": "write it again from memory, and count the pieces, not the strokes",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU COVER: write it again from memory, and count the pieces, not the strokes]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How many pieces in 起 (qǐ)? (Two — the walking piece and jǐ.) Which stroke runs under the whole character? (The long sweep, the seventh.) Which character comes before it in 对不起 (duìbuqǐ)? (不.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Source: Hanzi Writer Data 起 (qǐ), pinned stroke paths and medians."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
